round.review.reapplied.removed.list = Removed files (the first {0})
round.form.reapply = Re-apply filters
round.form.reapply.help = The round is waiting for review: you can change its filters. "Re-apply filters" selects its images again: files the filters chose before (also by "Distribute new files") that no longer pass are removed, new matches added; files added from a list and disqualified files stay as they are.
round.reapply.started = Round {0}: its filters are being re-applied. This page shows the result when it has finished.
round.reapply.not.in.review = Round {0} isn''t waiting for review: its filters can''t be re-applied.
round.reapply.voted = Round {0} has votes: its filters can''t be re-applied.
round.reapply.previous.self = Round {0} can take files only from rounds created before it.
round.reapply.failed = Could not re-apply the filters: {0}
round.reapply.failed.reference = Could not re-apply the filters. If it happens again, tell the organizers this reference: {0}.
job.error.reapply.voted = Round {0} got votes: its filters were not re-applied and no file was removed.
round.review.distribute.jurors.changed = Round {0}: its jurors have changed since this page was opened (a juror was added or stopped). Check the jurors below, then distribute.
round.review.distribute.reapply.unfinished = Round {0}: the last re-apply of its filters didn''t finish, so its images are only partly selected. Re-apply the filters again, or retry that job, then distribute.
round.review.reapply.unfinished = The last re-apply of the filters didn''t finish: the images are only partly selected. Re-apply the filters again (Edit the round) or retry its job before distributing.
job.error.review.not.in.review = Round {0} is no longer waiting for review: this job can''t be retried.

