account.join.mail.subject = Your accounts in the WLX Jury Tool were joined
account.join.mail.kept = Hello,\n\nYour account in the WLX Jury Tool and another account ({0}) were joined into yours by {1}: its contests, rounds, votes and comments are now in your account, and the other account has been retired. Your sessions have ended: sign in again.\n\nIf this is wrong, write to the contest''s admins.
