job.error.join.round.busy = Round {0} is getting its files or a new juror right now: Retry the join once that is done.
job.error.join.collision = Round {0}: {1} files have a vote of both accounts. Fix them by hand, then Retry.
job.error.join.invariant = Round {0}: moving the votes would break the round''s files'' consistency; nothing was moved in it.
job.error.join.retire.busy = A round of a contest of account #{0} is getting its files or a new juror right now: Retry the join once that is done.
