top.n.none = No top N: all matching files
top.n.choose.help = Candidate cuts are looked for among the first 100 places; the list offers every cut between different scores.
top.n.choose.placeholder = Choose N from the list
top.n.list.help = Only cuts between different scores are offered, so no tie is split. Files that can be taken: {0}.
top.n.candidates = Candidate cuts
top.n.changed = The previous rounds’ votes have changed since this round’s top N was chosen: check the candidates again.
top.n.scales = The previous rounds are on different scales; their scores are compared as they are.
