top.n.cuts.available = Cuts available: {0}
top.n.load.failed = The cuts could not be loaded. Change a filter to try again, or reload the page.
top.n.form.invalid = The cuts are listed once the form’s errors are corrected.
top.n.no.candidates = No file of the previous rounds matches the filters, so there is no cut to choose: choose “No top N”.
top.n.failed = Could not find the candidate cuts: {0}
top.n.failed.reference = Could not find the candidate cuts. If it happens again, tell the organizers this reference: {0}.
top.n.commons.unavailable = Commons could not be reached to read the category filter’s files, so the top N could not be checked. Nothing was saved. Try again later.
top.n.not.editable = Round {0}’s files are no longer chosen by its filters, so its top N can’t be changed.
